      47.85,
      400.09,
      539.91,
      459.16
    ],
    "text": "ACTING under the powers vested in it by Section 12(2) of the Consumer Affairs Authority Act, No. 09 of 2003, theConsumer Affairs Authority directs all manufacturers, importers, distributors and traders that they shall not manufacture,import, distribute, store or sell or display for sale, expose for sale or offer for sale, wholesale or retail, products/items ofoperating voltage not exceeding 250V and listed below, unless the said products/items bear the SLS Product CertificationMark issued by the Sri Lanka Standards Institution.",
